  "segments": [
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.196677,
      "compression_ratio": 1.569721,
      "end": 3604.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3600.0,
      "text": "救救我,救救我,就整个小区也没人管,这种冷漠,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.196677,
      "compression_ratio": 1.569721,
      "end": 3608.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3604.0,
      "text": "楼洞也没人管,他也出不去,他只有跳楼,他没办法,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.196677,
      "compression_ratio": 1.569721,
      "end": 3612.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3608.0,
      "text": "他说救救我就把被子点着,点着说你们救救我,救救我,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.196677,
      "compression_ratio": 1.569721,
      "end": 3616.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3612.0,
      "text": "一点着被子,结果被子把他给家给烧了,整个楼洞也烧了。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.196677,
      "compression_ratio": 1.569721,
      "end": 3624.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3618.0,
      "text": "整个河园的,四川的整个河园街,听说就是一样,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.196677,
      "compression_ratio": 1.569721,
      "end": 3629.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3624.0,
      "text": "喊救命救命我家死人了,还有喊生孩子的,没人管啊,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.166078,
      "compression_ratio": 1.285171,
      "end": 3635.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3629.0,
      "text": "那他就把被子点着了,点着是告诉你我求救的信号,像长城烽火台一样,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.166078,
      "compression_ratio": 1.285171,
      "end": 3638.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3635.0,
      "text": "结果烽火台失控了,把整个楼烧了。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.166078,
      "compression_ratio": 1.285171,
      "end": 3644.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3640.0,
      "text": "他就是这样子的,是吧?大家不要把他饿一会儿,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.166078,
      "compression_ratio": 1.285171,
      "end": 3647.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3644.0,
      "text": "火的,我要给你讲的,讲几个小时太多了啊。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.166078,
      "compression_ratio": 1.285171,
      "end": 3654.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3647.0,
      "text": "共产党,记住,五星出东方,立中华,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.166078,
      "compression_ratio": 1.285171,
      "end": 3657.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3654.0,
      "text": "当时共产党踩了这个所谓的迷信,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.15194,
      "compression_ratio": 1.216867,
      "end": 3663.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3657.0,
      "text": "无数个星星围着一个星星,共产党,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.15194,
      "compression_ratio": 1.216867,
      "end": 3668.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3663.0,
      "text": "就是老百姓你都是围着我转的,都是我的臣民,我的奴民,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.15194,
      "compression_ratio": 1.216867,
      "end": 3670.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3668.0,
      "text": "我是神的代表。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.15194,
      "compression_ratio": 1.216867,
      "end": 3674.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3672.0,
      "text": "然后还不让你信神。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.15194,
      "compression_ratio": 1.216867,
      "end": 3678.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3675.0,
      "text": "那么按照任何风水来看,现在,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.171423,
      "compression_ratio": 1.181818,
      "end": 3682.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3678.0,
      "text": "共产党的运气都没了,他最怕的是什么?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.171423,
      "compression_ratio": 1.181818,
      "end": 3686.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3682.0,
      "text": "他最怕的是火,因为他属木,东为木。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.171423,
      "compression_ratio": 1.181818,
      "end": 3692.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3687.0,
      "text": "共产党就是属木的,这火会烧死啊,一定会的。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.217667,
      "compression_ratio": 1.345946,
      "end": 3696.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3692.0,
      "text": "盘古,郁达的那个那个那个那个那个那个,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.217667,
      "compression_ratio": 1.345946,
      "end": 3699.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3696.0,
      "text": "真的是,还有更多的故事。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.217667,
      "compression_ratio": 1.345946,
      "end": 3704.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3700.0,
      "text": "傅士康,我可以告诉大家,今天可以毫不宽敞的说,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.217667,
      "compression_ratio": 1.345946,
      "end": 3706.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3704.0,
      "text": "我们很多这个原来的老员工都被抓了。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.217667,
      "compression_ratio": 1.345946,
      "end": 3712.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3707.0,
      "text": "在傅士康,郁达实习过,在郁达工作过,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.128188,
      "compression_ratio": 1.328358,
      "end": 3717.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3712.0,
      "text": "又到傅士康当领导层的,原来我以为是一千多,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.128188,
      "compression_ratio": 1.328358,
      "end": 3719.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3717.0,
      "text": "结果昨天那边告诉我三千多。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.128188,
      "compression_ratio": 1.328358,
      "end": 3725.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3720.0,
      "text": "郁达老员工管理层在这个傅士康超过一百个人。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.128188,
      "compression_ratio": 1.328358,
      "end": 3730.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3726.0,
      "text": "傅士康这场运动最早就是郁达老员工干的。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.128188,
      "compression_ratio": 1.328358,
      "end": 3734.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3731.0,
      "text": "就这么简单,当然他也是我们爆料革命战友啊,是吧?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.128188,
      "compression_ratio": 1.328358,
      "end": 3736.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3734.0,
      "text": "你能怎么着他呢?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.128188,
      "compression_ratio": 1.328358,
      "end": 3740.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3736.0,
      "text": "他是为了保命救更多的人,他看到了人,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.147224,
      "compression_ratio": 1.440191,
      "end": 3743.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3740.0,
      "text": "他最早给我说的,说他人活活的就扔出去了,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.147224,
      "compression_ratio": 1.440191,
      "end": 3745.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3743.0,
      "text": "装到垃圾袋里扔出去了。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.147224,
      "compression_ratio": 1.440191,
      "end": 3748.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3746.0,
      "text": "是吧?他们是勇士。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.147224,
      "compression_ratio": 1.440191,
      "end": 3753.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3749.0,
      "text": "他是不愧为七哥的曾经的同事。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.147224,
      "compression_ratio": 1.440191,
      "end": 3757.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3754.0,
      "text": "他们就应该这么做,死了也该这么做。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.147224,
      "compression_ratio": 1.440191,
      "end": 3761.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3757.0,
      "text": "你就不应该看到别人活活的被装到垃圾袋里边不吱声,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.147224,
      "compression_ratio": 1.440191,
      "end": 3764.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3761.0,
      "text": "那不就完了吗?是吧?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.169934,
      "compression_ratio": 1.088435,
      "end": 3783.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3770.0,
      "text": "对吧?大家现在都很清楚这个事情。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.169934,
      "compression_ratio": 1.088435,
      "end": 3786.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3783.0,
      "text": "所以傅士康就是因为我们爆料革命开始的。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.169934,
      "compression_ratio": 1.088435,
      "end": 3790.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3787.0,
      "text": "新疆里边没有比我们在新疆救的人太多的。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.16456,
      "compression_ratio": 1.29703,
      "end": 3792.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3790.0,
      "text": "上海,我可以告诉大家,为了你们知道,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.16456,
      "compression_ratio": 1.29703,
      "end": 3795.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3792.0,
      "text": "上海我们救出人是最多的。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.16456,
      "compression_ratio": 1.29703,
      "end": 3800.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3797.0,
      "text": "而且我相信上海还会有更多的大火,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.16456,
      "compression_ratio": 1.29703,
      "end": 3803.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3800.0,
      "text": "会烧起来。因为他们要救人,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.16456,
      "compression_ratio": 1.29703,
      "end": 3805.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3803.0,
      "text": "这是救人信号之火。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.16456,
      "compression_ratio": 1.29703,
      "end": 3808.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3805.0,
      "text": "人类有今天,当人发出呼救的声音的时候,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.16456,
      "compression_ratio": 1.29703,
      "end": 3809.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3808.0,
      "text": "就是着火。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.13426,
      "compression_ratio": 1.522388,
      "end": 3813.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3809.0,
      "text": "在这儿啊,在这儿啊,救我。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.13426,
      "compression_ratio": 1.522388,
      "end": 3817.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3815.0,
      "text": "这是人的本能。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.13426,
      "compression_ratio": 1.522388,
      "end": 3820.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3818.0,
      "text": "今天是,未来也会是。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.13426,
      "compression_ratio": 1.522388,
      "end": 3823.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3820.0,
      "text": "全人类上发的信号弹都是火发的。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.13426,
      "compression_ratio": 1.522388,
      "end": 3827.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3823.0,
      "text": "没有人发信号弹,发的水信号弹都是火信号弹。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.13426,
      "compression_ratio": 1.522388,
      "end": 3830.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3828.0,
      "text": "急救的信号就是火。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.13426,
      "compression_ratio": 1.522388,
      "end": 3833.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3830.0,
      "text": "火灾蔓延,火变大地的时候,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.13426,
      "compression_ratio": 1.522388,
      "end": 3836.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3833.0,
      "text": "就是这个国家的政权就应该消灭的时候。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.166638,
      "compression_ratio": 1.436842,
      "end": 3840.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3836.0,
      "text": "然后就是这个国家重新,重生的时候。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.166638,
      "compression_ratio": 1.436842,
      "end": 3842.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3840.0,
      "text": "有说过,是不是啊?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.166638,
      "compression_ratio": 1.436842,
      "end": 3846.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3842.0,
      "text": "涅槃的凤凰啊,这个火中的凤凰。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.166638,
      "compression_ratio": 1.436842,
      "end": 3848.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3846.0,
      "text": "你听说过水中的凤凰吗?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.166638,
      "compression_ratio": 1.436842,
      "end": 3850.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3848.0,
      "text": "那叫落水的机。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.166638,
      "compression_ratio": 1.436842,
      "end": 3857.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3852.0,
      "text": "落水的机,水为沙河生,先沙后生。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.166638,
      "compression_ratio": 1.436842,
      "end": 3861.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3857.0,
      "text": "火是直接沙漠,火中寄生。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.166638,
      "compression_ratio": 1.436842,
      "end": 3864.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3861.0,
      "text": "火和直接生,火寄生。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.141107,
      "compression_ratio": 1.168142,
      "end": 3868.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3864.0,
      "text": "第五,国内民众的抗疫如火如荼,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.141107,
      "compression_ratio": 1.168142,
      "end": 3870.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3868.0,
      "text": "针对中共疯狂的抓捕,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.141107,
      "compression_ratio": 1.168142,
      "end": 3872.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3870.0,
      "text": "以及面临临时被隔离,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.141107,
      "compression_ratio": 1.168142,
      "end": 3874.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3872.0,
      "text": "断网,断通信的危险。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.141107,
      "compression_ratio": 1.168142,
      "end": 3879.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3874.0,
      "text": "请问几个,墙内民众如何进行智慧有效的抗争,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.141107,
      "compression_ratio": 1.168142,
      "end": 3883.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3879.0,
      "text": "同时又尽可能的能够保护自身的安全谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.141107,
      "compression_ratio": 1.168142,
      "end": 3885.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3883.0,
      "text": "那太容易了,是吧?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.152093,
      "compression_ratio": 1.228395,
      "end": 3889.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3885.0,
      "text": "顺便不小心扔个烟头,是吧?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.152093,
      "compression_ratio": 1.228395,
      "end": 3892.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3889.0,
      "text": "顺便,是不是?撒点汽油。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.152093,
      "compression_ratio": 1.228395,
      "end": 3897.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3892.0,
      "text": "顺便打开天然气,是吧?管道,是吧?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.152093,
      "compression_ratio": 1.228395,
      "end": 3903.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3897.0,
      "text": "顺便把那些抓老百姓的隔离集中营,是吧?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.152093,
      "compression_ratio": 1.228395,
      "end": 3907.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 3903.0,
      "text": "旁边山山火火,轴点火,是吧?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.151992,
      "compression_ratio": 1.371429,
      "end": 3909.0,
