    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.109505,
      "compression_ratio": 1.335821,
      "end": 4219.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 4214.0,
      "text": "会的。但是呢,指望他们是不可能的。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.109505,
      "compression_ratio": 1.335821,
      "end": 4223.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 4219.0,
      "text": "资本主义,什么叫主义啊?有钱有主义,没钱没主义。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.109505,
      "compression_ratio": 1.335821,
      "end": 4226.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 4223.0,
      "text": "有钱给你干活,没钱啥都不给你干。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.109505,
      "compression_ratio": 1.335821,
      "end": 4230.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 4226.0,
      "text": "宗教、信仰、理想,都是以资本为前提。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.117747,
      "compression_ratio": 1.381526,
      "end": 4234.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 4230.0,
      "text": "有资本有主义,没资本没主义。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.117747,
      "compression_ratio": 1.381526,
      "end": 4238.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 4234.0,
      "text": "咱谁也别做梦,只有自己行动。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.117747,
      "compression_ratio": 1.381526,
      "end": 4243.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 4238.0,
      "text": "会和我们在一起,会跟我们帮助,会敲鞭骨。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.117747,
      "compression_ratio": 1.381526,
      "end": 4249.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 4243.0,
      "text": "他们现在如果今天宣布说,我们跟中共国脱钩,美国和欧洲。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.117747,
      "compression_ratio": 1.381526,
      "end": 4257.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 4249.0,
      "text": "我们从现在去查封所有中共在海外的官员资产,禁止中共官员到海外来,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.117747,
      "compression_ratio": 1.381526,
      "end": 4260.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 4257.0,
      "text": "把中共官员列为像伊朗一样。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.237935,
      "compression_ratio": 1.086957,
      "end": 4268.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 4260.0,
      "text": "国民自卫队,那个所谓的宗教部队,护卫军成为恐怖主司。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.237935,
      "compression_ratio": 1.086957,
      "end": 4271.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 4268.0,
      "text": "那不就完了吗?还有老百姓烧吗?"
